{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47149","headline":"再宿京口禅院 · 栖蟾","name":"再宿京口禅院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"滩声依旧水溶溶，岸影参差对梵宫。\n楚树七回凋旧叶，江人两至宿秋风。\n蟾蜍竹老摇疎白，菡萏池乾落碎红。\n多病支郎念行止，晚年生计转如蓬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"栖蟾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47149.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47149","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}